WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.270
On the first day man was granted

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:08.250
A soul, and with it - Clarity. For in man, great potential was seen.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.130
Yet on the second day upon earth was
planted

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:16.150
An irrevocable poison. A soul devouring Demon.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.680
For, like the demon - man had an insatiable,

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.830
destructive appetite for souls. For power.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.660
And so, the scourge began

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.580
As God's two most terrible creations: Man and It's Demon's

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.940
fought towards extinction.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.840
You came for demons souls?

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.839
Or to save this land, and be remembered as a hero?

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:44.829
[laughs]

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:48.980
Hunting for demon's

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.510
That is why you came, is it not? To this accursed Boletaria?

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.539
Can't you see

00:00:55.539 --> 00:01:00.530
you've fallen for their trap? In the dark state of our land,

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:02.600
Legends are all we can depend upon.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.100
I refused to believe

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.810
that this is what father wished for our great land.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:10.880
You have a heart of gold.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.350
Don't let them take it from you!

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.979
surely you have seen for yourself..

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:21.320
the pain and the suffering that fills this world..?

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:25.610
But fight poison with poison. God is merciful,

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:29.740
and so, created the Old One. The Old One will feed

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:33.570
upon our souls..and put an end to our tragic

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.700
of existance.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:43.700
But perhaps our age will see the rise of new Heroes...

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:49.840
 

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.270
 

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:54.850
 

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:59.420
Do you intend to challenge the King? 
You may be a great demon hunter..

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:02.189
but I feel you may not be ready.

00:02:02.189 --> 00:02:04.759
Beware the limits of your own power.

